  "provenBehavior": [
    "InitTrig_allability registers global SPELL_EFFECT to Trig_allabilityActions; damage action has positive/enemy/non-A2Y7 guards and disables itself around its body.",
    "A0I5 damage elseif follows A0XM and precedes DemonStatueBounce/A0I1/A0ID; mana strictly >24 issues cripple to damage source regardless of command success.",
    "Spell effect excludes Pn=e008. Range enumeration centered at primary target uses radius 200. Only enemies without B04U at enumeration get independent 1-second timers. No per-unit timer deduplication exists beyond current B04U observation.",
    "Dummy cripple success is not a prerequisite for timer creation; script saves source and target handles first. Dummy receives A0I5 and damage-source mapping, requested life=10000 and removal after 2 seconds.",
    "At each callback absence of B04U or death of either party selects 90 terminal damage and A0I7 level-1 thunderbolt request, then timer destruction; else deals 10. No fixed 5-tick counter or unconditional 50+90 damage.",
    "Both script damage calls use ATTACK_TYPE_NORMAL, the JASS Spells row, and DAMAGE_TYPE_MAGIC. Armor value does not mitigate magic; attack-row multipliers, immunity and magic resistance apply.",
